smoke st1 life 1 prefix 12000: G1-G6, G9 ok; G7 (life88 rows, s88 l2lstep! terminal M.list and T, C=inf) ok; origins twinned 6; |U| 18
smoke s80 life 40 prefix 12000: G1-G6, G9 ok; G7 (life88 rows, s88 l2lstep! terminal M.list and T, C=inf) ok; origins twinned 6; |U| 17
G6 main evictions > 0 at C=1 and C=2: ok
gates: G1 K = official FGT counters bitwise (all C, main, flipped and unflipped twins, every step); G2 C=0 table = replay84 every main step, C=0 twin table = FGT twin every step, C=0 twin D_s(T, Q) = FGT bitwise; G3 M aggregates = recount from M.list (end of life, every twin read point, every U point); G4 unflipped twin table and M.list = main at every read point; G5 R1 independent form every step of every branch, at s exactly one branch keeps when p_s != 1/2 (C>=1: tail is s only there), none and M.list unchanged when p_s = 1/2; G6 independent reference (own counters, own R1, M_ref = last(hist, C)) = M.list on every main and twin step incl. s, finite C in (1, 2): length <= C, unchanged when R1 does not keep, head-out + order + tail when full, main evictions > 0 at C=1 and C=2; G9 p_K = FGT table, C=0 dG_O1 == 0.0, key class m>0 = any in M.list, |dG_O1 - (direct + rate-only)| < 1e-12 at every U point
note: smoke prints no S89-E1..E3 quantity and no N3 / D_s value; G8 and the printed-digit part of G7 run only in run.
